      "id": "claim_1418192c938d4920801a53e134d6c56f",
      "statement": "The n8n workflow runs every 12 hours and holds no filtering or deduplication logic of its own — it only schedules, calls the backend, gates on results, and mails; search and cross-run dedup both live in the backend.",
