      "id": "claim_57ef50ab38674745924125eef28ca42f",
      "statement": "POST /digest/sent inserts each link into the n8njobs table with ON CONFLICT (joblink) DO NOTHING; the workflow calls it only after Gmail succeeds, so a failed email after a successful search does not mark listings sent, and the idempotent insert makes the worst case a repeated email rather than a missing one — the workflow never emails the same job twice across runs.",
